window.products.push({"id":487113,"name":"Mr IRONSTONE Coat Rack Shoe Bench, 3-in-1 Hall Tree Entryway Storage Shelf Coat Rack Stand with Hanging Bar and 9 Hooks Easy Assembly (White Marble)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dZa0yVetL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPACE-SAVING 3 IN 1 DESIGN: Coat rack, Shoe Bench and Storage Shelf make everything handy when you’re in a hurry. With 9 hooks and a clothes rail for bags and 2 metal wire shelves for shoes,there is also a higher place for boots or high heels. DIMENSION & CAPACITY:31.5\"L*11.8\"W*71.5\"H.The shoe rack bench is constructed by high quality P2 MDF Board and strong metal frame. Desk frame is made of heavy duty powder coated steel which ensures stability and durability. High load capacity of up to 6.6 lbs per hook and 200s lb for the MDF bench top FOR MORE OCCASIONS: 3 in 1 design, make the most of your space, easy to fit snugly in a corner to maximize your limited space. Multifunctional shoe bench fits well in the lavatory, hallway, entryway, foyer, bedroom, etc. FAST INSTALLATION & EASY CLEANING: with quite clear and detailed instructions, numbered parts, and all necessary tools in the package.It is easy and quick to assemble the shoe rack with bench. What You Get: A Coat rack shoe bench, adjustable feet, easy-to-follow instructions, and a simple assembly process.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dZa0yVetL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr IRONSTONE","source_asin":"B086WVPR2Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-487113","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086WVPR2Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086WVPR2Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":487114,"name":"AOCKS Roll-Up Folding Over The Sink Multipurpose Roll-Up Dish Drying Rack Home Fit for Stainless Steel Sink (Green+)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l4cZHYmrL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Features: This unique stainless steel drying rack rolls out to fit neatly over your standard sized kitchen sink. Environmental silicon material on both ends, non-slip and used safety. The diameter of stainless steel tube is up to 6mm, solid and durable. Water drips off your dishes and straight into the sink, no more watery messes or wasted space on your counter tops. Easily rolls up to save space and stored when not in use. Perfect for rising vegetables and fruits or as a draining rack for dishes. With EMBATHER’s extra modern design ;the sink dish drainer ,not only dose it solutions to air-dry washed bowls, pot, fry pans, tableware, cookware so on, but also can be used as fresh cut fruits and vegetables colander ,even drain Spaghetti. The drying rack can be rolled up. When you are not using the drying rack, you can roll up the drying rack put on the sink or in a cabinets, to help you save space. You can put the items you want to dry on the drying rack, such as: plates, coffee cups, fruits, vegetables, tableware, kitchen utensils and so on.  You can put food on the drying rack for cooling, such as bread, cakes and so on.  You can also put the food on the drying rack for thawing, such as frozen meat, frozen fish and so on. Note: Due to the difference between different monitors, the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item. Thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l4cZHYmrL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AOCKS","source_asin":"B07C4QXJXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-487114","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C4QXJXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C4QXJXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
