window.products.push({"id":487391,"name":"Coralpearl Garlic Ginger Press Cutter Mincer Chopper Crusher Slicer Grater Grinder Dicer Machine Food Aid in Plastic Stainless Steel with Silicone Pee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617CNFQ444L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"* Color: GREEN * Material:100% plastic new material ABS + Stainless Steel, Silicone  * Shape: Round or Cube  * Round Size: Press: 7.5cm D. X 6cm H/3\" Dia. X 2.4\"H  Peeler: 8cm Dia. X 7.5cm H/3.2\" Dia. X 3\"H 2 pieces NO BOX:16cm L X 8cm W X 8cm H/6\"L X 3\"W X 3\"H * Cube Size: Press: 6.5cm L X 6cm W X 7cm H/2.6\"L X 2.4\"W X 2.8\"H Peeler: 8cm Dia. X 7.5cm H/3.2\" Dia. X 3\"H 2 pieces NO BOX: 14.5cm L X 14cm W X 7.5cm H/6\"L X 6\"W X 3\"H TIPS: To protect the blades for long time use & not to bend the Cutter, pls cut the whole garlic unit into thin pieces; Fix the grid cover into the cutter & push not too hard by hand. Here is your FINAL STOP for easy cooking with Coralpearl garlic ginger set! Perfect Kitchen Gadget Tools for Food prep. aid! Two sturdy Interchangeable blades ensure consistent result every single time: one as mincer/dicer/chopper, one as crusher/slicer machine. With unique design for multiple functions as a Chopper Crusher Slicer Dicer Machine , this SET peels, minces or slices garlic into the small pieces very fast and keeps your hands from garlic odor.  How To Use:  --GARLIC PEELER:  1. Remove both tips of garlic. 2. Simply place a clove of garlic into the silicone garlic peeler.  3. 4.Roll peeler back and forth firmly between hands or on countertop. 5. Tip out peeled garlic cloves. 6.7. Turn peeler inside/out, wash with warm water or in the top rack of dishwasher.  --GARLIC CUTTER: 1. Choose what size you want to cut the garlic. 2. Simply place the peeled clove on the blade. 3. Press/push down the lid to chop the garlic. 4. All the minced garlic are conveniently stored in removable clear container, Bottom of which is indented to act as a micro Grater/Grinder for soft foods; EASY for storage: Miniature PORTABLE size for convenient COMPACT storage anywhere in kitchen, in draws, cabinets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617CNFQ444L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coralpearl","source_asin":"B09BQPW523","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-487391","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BQPW523","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BQPW523","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
