window.products.push({"id":487628,"name":"ApronMen, Highly Unlikely BBQ Grill Adjustable Apron for Men, One Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Il9aN0fNL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton Drawstring closure Machine Wash Professional Quality: Made from 100% cotton, 7oz twill, our professional print design merges comfort with toughness as this grill apron with pockets can withstand the heat of any kitchen or BBQ. Looking For the Perfect Gift? Our cooking aprons for men are fun and functional grilling gifts will actually be used. Our customers rave about how our aprons made the perfect gift for their loved one. One Size Fits All: Measuring 30\" L x 24\" W our chef apron for men is durable with an all-in-one adjustable sliding neck loop and extra long waist ties (tie in the back or front). Our unique design ensures your BBQ apron won’t tear apart at the seams. Large Pockets: Our grilling aprons with pockets are the perfect cook accessory gifts for dads who have everything. Our three large pockets and one smaller pocket design will hold all of your kitchen and BBQ utensils. ApronMen: We are a local business in Wenatchee WA. with a unique mission: to make great gifts. A great gift blesses both the giver and receiver, and aprons are our way of filling the world with a little more joy, happiness, and generosity.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Il9aN0fNL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ApronMen","source_asin":"B07S2CHQ2H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-487628","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S2CHQ2H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S2CHQ2H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":487629,"name":"Joeyan Handmade Blue Crackle Drinking Glasses Cups,Large Crystal Water Glass Tumblers,Aesthetics Glassware Collection,Unique Gift,Set of 2,19 oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uzMAf9RjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Traditional Mouth Blown Craftsmanship: The modern technology of making a glassware by machine is fast and efficient. However, the traditional way of making a glassware by mouth and hand is more of an art. Each Joeyan blue crackle drinking glass cup was carefully handmade by skilled blowers. No two pieces are exactly the same, making each piece a little different in size and shape, but also making each piece the only one in the world. Unique Blue Ice Crackle Design: This blue crackle drinking glass cup set is sophisticated and pretty. To make the blue crackle effect, we need prepare 2 stoves, one for transparent materials and the other for blue colored materials. A skilled blower will need blow, beat, merge and adjust, and each step needs skill, speed and control. Because of the special craftsmanship, it is more of an artwork than an ordinary crystal wine glass, with display and collection value. Notes and Attention: Because of the special production craftsmanship and effect, even for a skilled blower, it is easy to make flaws such as bubbles, black dots, streamlines, and so on. Guests who mind this please consider twice before order. ATTENTION: All our crackle glass cups MUSTN'T be washed by a dishwasher, nor can hold hot liquids. HANDSWASH ONLY. Great Gift Idea: This mixed drinkware set is with a large capacity of 19 oz, height around 5.9\", diameter around 2.6\". Great for drinking water, juice, beverages, cocktails, iced tea and coffee, soda, and more. The sepcial and unique design and craftmanship makes it a good gift idea for home and bar essentials, Christmas, Birthday, Weddings, Anniversary, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Valentine, Thanksgiving Day, Teacher's Day, and so on. Brand Service: Joeyan is an honest supplier with reputation. We offer free replacements 90 days after purchase without any reasons. If you have a question or doult, please be free to contact us via \"Contact Seller\". We will reply within 24 hours, and, we will propose solutions to solve your problem till you are satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uzMAf9RjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joeyan","source_asin":"B0B5CSQT32","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-487629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5CSQT32","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5CSQT32","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
