window.products.push({"id":487976,"name":"Imperial Home 7 Pc Carbon Steel Nonstick Cookware Set, Pots & Pans Set, Dishwasher Safe Cookware Set, Cooking Set, Kitchen Essentials (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.03,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lmmWILgYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUICK & EVEN HEATING: Cook quality and delicious tasting food with Imperial Home's cookware sets. Each pot and pan included in this kitchen set conducts heat fast and evenly with accurate temperature distribution. Allowing food to cook faster and more evenly across the surface. LONG LASTING: This pots and pans cookware set is made from high grade carbon steel and highly durable, so it’s sure to last in your kitchen for years to come without rusting or tarnishing. COMFORTABLE HANDLES: This dish set features a plastic handle on each dish allowing you to easily move each pot/pan from a stove top to wherever you need it without burning your hand. EASY CLEAN UP: Easy to clean up pans for cooking! A nonstick cooking set that's safe to go in the dishwasher making cleaning that much easier! Cook any type of food you want in this pot and pan set without having to worry about the messy clean up later. WHAT'S INCLUDED: This kitchen pots and pans set includes one 3 qt dutch oven,1.6 qt sauce pan, 1.2 qt sauce pan with matching lids, and a 9\" frying pan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lmmWILgYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Imperial Home","source_asin":"B07N32Y427","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-487976","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N32Y427","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N32Y427","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":487977,"name":"Melange Coupe 16-Piece Porcelain Dinnerware Set (Grey Harmony) | Service for 4 | Microwave, Dishwasher & Oven Safe | Dinner Plate, Salad Plate, Soup B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x4Ux+DpAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Melange Melange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We believe fine dinner sets shouldn’t mean fragile dinner sets. We believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That’s why we’ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye. An Everyday Porcelain Dinner Plate Set Designed to Last and Impress Impress your guests, crown that dinner party, or upgrade your everyday dinnerware with an elegant porcelain coupe dinner set that epitomizes durability. We’ve combined high-quality porcelain with a unique chip-resistant design to create a porcelain set that you can use every single day without dealing with constant cracking, flaking, or chipping. - Vitrified at temperatures of over 2480F. - Microwave, oven and dishwasher safe. - 0% porosity for greater durability. - Complete set for service of 4 or 8. - Elegant floral pattern and lovely glaze. Designed to Last We’ve adopted a premium approach to treat you to a dinner plate set that will serve you for years. Not only is the porcelain treated at higher temperatures to make it much stronger but the place sets have special rounded edges that keep chipping at bay, and the high-heat treated porcelain never absorbs any moisture that leads to cracking like others do. For Daily Use No dealing with fragile porcelain dinner sets that you only whip out whenever you have company. Melange dinnerware is strong enough to handle the rigors of daily use. You can safely use it in the microwave, clean it in the dishwasher without breaking, and even use it to reheat food in the oven up to 400F. Everything You Need Every set comes with a dinner plate, salad plate, soup bowl and a mug; everything you need to serve your family or guests a full course meal. Choose between our 16-piece set that comes with 4 of each piece of cutlery and serves 4, or our 32-piece dinner set that comes with 8 of each and serves 8. Understated Elegance Simple yet eye-catching, our range of designs exude an effortless elegance that blends into just about any setting. Beautifully done floral detailing meets lovely colors and a well-done glaze to create porcelain place settings with a premium feel. Get one set for yourself and a couple more as gifts and experience the magic of Melange.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x4Ux+DpAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B01LB4K2FG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-487977","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LB4K2FG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LB4K2FG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
